        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-LEED-MASTER-CERTIFICATION-THEOREMS-1-25.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-MASTER-CERTIFICATION-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TIER1-THEOREMS-1-5-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TIER2-THEOREMS-6-10-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TIER3-THEOREMS-11-15-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TIER4-THEOREMS-16-20-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TIER5-THEOREMS-21-25-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-HEART-QUALIFIED    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-LEED-PLATINUM-SEAL       PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-MASTER-CERTIFICATE.
            GOBACK.
        1000-VERIFY-MASTER-CERTIFICATE.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TIER1-THEOREMS-1-5-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TIER2-THEOREMS-6-10-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TIER3-THEOREMS-11-15-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TIER4-THEOREMS-16-20-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TIER5-THEOREMS-21-25-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TEDDY_BEAR-HEART-QUALIFIED = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-LEED-PLATINUM-SEAL
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-LEED-PLATINUM-SEAL.
